{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"4905216d57f864052d47590d26be067873dba1ca0428664078577874b47bf1e8","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cobbles now look convincingly solid with deeper joints, though the lane effect is still hard to judge by eye. I'll add a relief-strength uniform for comparisons, which can also serve as a quality toggle to skip relief cost at low settings.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DLDZgBVZmm51BtoR7PHP9z","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\np = 'js/terrain.js'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"      uWaterLevel: shared.waterLevel || { value: -1e4 },\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"      uWaterLevel: shared.waterLevel || { value: -1e4 },\n      uRelief: shared.relief || { value: 1 },\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"\"\"        uniform float uWet, uTime, uRain, uWaterLevel, uSwardR;\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"        uniform float uWet, uTime, uRain, uWaterLevel, uSwardR, uRelief;\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"\"\"          vec4 sc = vec4(0.06, 0.012, 0.025, 0.035) * fade;\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"          vec4 sc = vec4(0.06, 0.012, 0.025, 0.035) * fade * uRelief;\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\n\np = 'js/main.js'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"  wet: { value: 1 }, time: { value: 0 }, rain: { value: 1 }, waterLevel: { value: LEVEL.water?.level ?? -1e4 },\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"  wet: { value: 1 }, time: { value: 0 }, rain: { value: 1 }, waterLevel: { value: LEVEL.water?.level ?? -1e4 },\n  relief: { value: 1 },       // the ground's relief near the eye (terrain.js), by quality\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"\"\"  G?.grass?.setCount(quality.blades ?? 0);\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"  G?.grass?.setCount(quality.blades ?? 0);\n  shared.relief.value = quality.relief ?? 1;\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\n\np = 'js/config.js'\ns = open(p).read()\nfor q, v in (('high', 1), ('medium', 1), ('low', 0)):\n    i = s.index(f'  {q}: {{')\n    j = s.index('treeNear', i)\n    s = s[:j] + f'relief: {v}, ' + s[j:]\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPYEOF\nfor f in js/terrain.js js/main.js js/config.js; do node --check $f || echo FAIL $f; done; grep -n \"relief\" js/config.js | cut -c1-150; grep -n \"^const shared\\|function applyGraphics\" js/main.js","description":"Add a relief strength uniform driven by quality"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
