"assistant","uuid":"6a065967-f7c8-4a00-88e8-4caf02db776b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:39:39.709Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"6a065967-f7c8-4a00-88e8-4caf02db776b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kn8ZEYCh9DswhGHC2NtmT2","type":"tool_result","content":"23:and verges are tens of thousands of single blades of grass that bend in\n24-the wind and part round your legs, and the\n25-renderer adds wet ground — dark, glossy cobbles with water in the joints\n26-(and, near the eye, real depth: the stones stand proud of their joints, the\n27-mud keeps its ruts, the march of the view ray through the height maps),\n28-puddles with soaked margins in the hollows that mirror the lit windows, the\n29-lamps and the glow of the sky, broken by rain rings, river banks soaked\n--\n104:  * `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU: one instanced draw of tufts of\n105-    blades round the camera (high ~21 m, medium ~14 m, none on low), each\n106-    placed, sized and leaned by a hash of its world cell, on a ground map\n107-    made at load from the terrain's own splat (none on roads, mud, steep\n108-    banks, at the water or inside anything solid); the ground under it\n109-    turns to dark, dry sward\n110-  * `materials.js` palette-keyed wet materials · `sky.js`, `weather.js`","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"30bc73a0-49c2-4269-b2cd-0600ccb071cd","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:39:40.541Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"23:and verges are tens of thousands of single blades of grass that bend in\n24-the wind and part round your legs, and the\n25-renderer adds wet ground — dark, glossy cobbles with water in the joints\n26-(and, near the eye, real depth: the stones stand proud of their joints, the\n27-mud keeps its ruts, the march of the view ray through the height maps),\n28-puddles with soaked margins in the hollows that mirror the lit windows, the\n29-lamps and the glow of the sky, broken by rain rings, river banks soaked\n--\n104:  * `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU: one instanced draw of tufts of\n105-    blades round the camera (high ~21 m, medium ~14 m, none on low), each\n106-    placed, sized and leaned by a hash of its world cell, on a ground map\n107-    made at load from the terrain's own splat (none on roads, mud, steep\n108-    banks, at the water or inside anything solid); the ground under it\n109-    turns to dark, dry sward\n110-  * `materials.js` palette-keyed wet materials · `sky.js`, `weather.js`","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"804feb80-70cf-4940-ad60-d6681b9c9e73","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":4,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6a065967-f7c8-4a00-88e8-4caf02db776b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
