{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"d53ab9875348e37965efff868e864a251966e7b35582ada6f6d33ce2d7d0af04","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QyRgfNFszFsjwgbjWDaSnC","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"and verges are tens of thousands of single blades of grass that bend in\nthe wind and part round your legs, and the","new_string":"and verges are tens of thousands of single blades of grass that bend in\nthe wind and part round your legs, stones lie in the mud of the lanes and\nyards and twigs on the forest floor, and the"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WundvAFoaGHCu3e94kJkka","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"  * `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU: one instanced draw of tufts of\n    blades round the camera (high ~21 m, medium ~14 m, none on low), each\n    placed, sized and leaned by a hash of its world cell, on a ground map\n    made at load from the terrain's own splat (none on roads, mud, steep\n    banks, at the water or inside anything solid); the ground under it\n    turns to dark, dry sward","new_string":"  * `groundmap.js` what grows and lies where, made at load from the\n    terrain mesh's own splat: grass, stones and fallen wood (none on roads,\n    steep banks, at the water or inside anything solid), and the ground's\n    height as the mesh draws it · `grass.js` the meadow grass on the GPU:\n    one instanced draw of tufts of blades round the camera (high ~21 m,\n    medium ~14 m, none on low), each placed, sized and leaned by a hash of\n    its world cell; tufts out of view collapse before the expensive part;\n    the ground under it turns to dark, dry sward · `clutter.js` the same\n    for stones (grit to fist-sized, a third sunk) and twigs within ~9 m,\n    lying along the slope (high and medium)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UFpBZ85Y1a3JjdkVk9pQUc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && L=\"$TMPDIR\"; for t in world-check lod-check distance-check ai-check fp-check; do node tests/$t.mjs > \"$L/$t.log\" 2>&1 && echo \"$t ok\" || { echo \"$t FAILED\"; tail -5 \"$L/$t.log\"; }; done; cd ../.. && git status --short","description":"Run the tests and list changed files","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
