b31e0-5276-4182-883c-95a2ba296c46","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgFVQpxLoiVMu9648iB8h","requestRef":"075e7690-b465-48df-9d36-f566b4367fc6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"eac63bc3-4c75-4734-adcc-a9047399f3af","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:50:53.451Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"eac63bc3-4c75-4734-adcc-a9047399f3af","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014jzgTqcio9d8PgTeEPj3Kt","type":"tool_result","content":"23790503 Hedgerow graphics: ground clutter\nIn first person the ground is a metre and a half from the eyes, so it\ngets the small things a fought-over village has: leaves and litter along\nthe foot of the walls, brick and plaster bits thick round the two\nshelled houses and thrown out into the street, stones, sticks and leaves\nalong the sunken lane's banks and the forest track, and behind each\nmachine-gun nest the leavings of the fighting (ammunition boxes, a\nhelmet, a jerrycan). 370 pieces of models the sets already have, drawn\nas ground cover near the camera (nothing to walk round, no effect on the\nroutes); its own seed keeps the vegetation where it was, and levelBuild\ndrops any piece that would land inside something solid.\n\ntests/clutter-check.mjs checks the pieces exist, lie beside things rather\nthan in them (40 of 410 dropped), stay out of the river and the middle of\nthe street.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n\n fun/hedgerow/README.md                |  7 +++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/levelBuild.js         | 17 +++++++++\n fun/hedgerow/js/levels/saint-clair.js | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n fun/hedgerow/tests/clutter-check.mjs  | 33 +++++++++++++++++\n 4 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n--- merge\na5c4deff Merge hedgerow-grass: meadow grass, ground relief, stones and twigs at your feet, bark close up\n\n fun/hedgerow/README.md       |  24 ++++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/clutter.js   | 205 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n fun/hedgerow/js/config.js    |   6 +-\n fun/hedgerow/js/grass.js     | 225 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------\n fun/hedgerow/js/groundmap.js | 147 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n fun/hedgerow/js/main.js      |  21 +++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js |  53 +++++++++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/terrain.js   |  97 +++++++++++++++++--\n 8 files changed, 646 insertions(+), 132 deletions(-)\n33:import { createClutter } from './clutter.js';\n161:  G.clutter = createClutter({ map: G.groundMap, shared, on: quality.clutter ?? 0 });\n162:  scene.add(G.clutter.group);\n252:  G?.clutter?.setOn(quality.clutter ?? 0);\n551:  G.clutter.update(camera);","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2f64add7-7b89-454d-97c7-13355a2905d8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T13:50:54.753Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"23790503 Hedgerow graphics: ground clutter\nIn first person the ground is a metre and a half from the eyes, so it\ngets the small things a fought-over village has: leaves and litter along\nthe foot of the walls, brick and plaster bits thick round the two\nshelled houses and thrown out into the street, stones, sticks and leaves\nalong the sunken lane's banks and the forest track, and behind each\nmachine-gun nest the leavings of the fighting (ammunition boxes, a\nhelmet, a jerrycan). 370 pieces of models the sets already have, drawn\nas ground cover near the camera (nothing to walk round, no effect on the\nroutes); its own seed keeps the vegetation where it was, and levelBuild\ndrops any piece that would land inside something solid.\n\ntests/clutter-check.mjs checks the pieces exist, lie beside things rather\nthan in them (40 of 410 dropped), stay out of the river and the middle of\nthe street.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n\n fun/hedgerow/README.md                |  7 +++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/levelBuild.js         | 17 +++++++++\n fun/hedgerow/js/levels/saint-clair.js | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-\n fun/hedgerow/tests/clutter-check.mjs  | 33 +++++++++++++++++\n 4 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n--- merge\na5c4deff Merge hedgerow-grass: meadow grass, ground relief, stones and twigs at your feet, bark close up\n\n fun/hedgerow/README.md       |  24 ++++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/clutter.js   | 205 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n fun/hedgerow/js/config.js    |   6 +-\n fun/hedgerow/js/grass.js     | 225 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------\n fun/hedgerow/js/groundmap.js | 147 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n fun/hedgerow/js/main.js      |  21 +++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js |  53 +++++++++-\n fun/hedgerow/js/terrain.js   |  97 +++++++++++++++++--\n 8 files changed, 646 insertions(+), 132 deletions(-)\n33:import { createClutter } from './clutter.js';\n161:  G.clutter = createClutter({ map: G.groundMap, shared, on: quality.clutter ?? 0 });\n162:  scene.add(G.clutter.group);\n252:  G?.clutter?.setOn(quality.clutter ?? 0);\n551:  G.clutter.update(camera);","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2adb31e0-5276-4182-883c-95a2ba296c46","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow","branch":"hedgerow-poc","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eac63bc3-4c75-4734-adcc-a9047399f3af","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HE