{"parentUuid":"651d98e6-d6b5-49d5-8b65-12353889887b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFVS7PpeMou5AbcQJLbb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RJmrYjKfAKn2wtKupUcxcs","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","content":"# hedgerow-grass session (graphics rounds)\n\nBranch `hedgerow-grass`, worktree `.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass`, now fast-forwarded to `hedgerow-poc` a5c4deff.\n\nDone and merged into hedgerow-poc (a5c4deff):\n- meadow grass (grass.js), ground relief near the eye (terrain.js parallax)\n- stones and twigs (clutter.js + groundmap.js), grass culled to the view\n- close-up bark and moss on tree trunks (materials.js)\n\nTried and dropped: raindrops beaded on rifles/outfits (unreadable at this resolution and lighting).\n\nWorking on now: **illumination flares** over the front (new flares.js; small hooks in\nlights.js for a far, moving light; sky.js glow; volumetric.js per-light fog factor;\neffects.js flare sprite; main.js wiring). Not touching camera.js, player.js, hud.js,\ncharacter.js.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1001,"cache_read_input_tokens":690206,"output_tokens":1241,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":473},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1001,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":690206,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1001,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1001},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01RJmrYjKfAKn2wtK